+++ b/changelog/70129.added.md
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Add support to the `diskusage` beacon for alerting when a mount's usage drops below a configured `minimum` threshold, in addition to the existing `maximum` (high-usage) threshold. This helps catch filesystems that silently failed to mount. Existing scalar percentage configuration for high-usage alerts is unaffected.
diff --git a/salt/beacons/diskusage.py b/salt/beacons/diskusage.py
